OL,5,G2000 Pete Wicks: For Dogs' Sake
OL,6,     FThe Shih Tzus, Spud and Kaiser:
OL,7,     FPete helps train one of Dogs
OL,8,     FTrust's longest-staying residents
OL,9,     Fand supports eleven Shih Tzus all
OL,10,     Frescued from the same household.
OL,11,G2100 Inside the Ambulance
