OL,5,G2200 Ambulance
OL,6,     FAs the night shift begins, 82
OL,7,     Fpatients across the North West are
OL,8,     Fwaiting for an ambulance. With a
OL,9,     Fnew call being taken every 30
OL,10,     Fseconds, paramedics are pushed to
OL,11,     Ftheir limits.
OL,12,G2300 Death Row: Countdown to Execution
OL,13,     FNew. Susanna meets Darlie Routier,
OL,14,     Fwho for 23 years has claimed she
OL,15,     Fhad no part in the murder of her
OL,16,     Ftwo young sons, who were stabbed
OL,17,     Fto death a few feet away from
OL,18,     Fwhere she was sleeping.
